103188.8 gpu: world lighting-control control=%detailtype kind=material-key state=refused declared=19 visible=19 resolved=0 missing=19 materials=19 triangles=43851 requested=0 effective=0 parsed=1 first=WOOD/WOOD_FLOOR002 resource=materials/overlays/detail006.vmt reason=detail layers are the --world-detail switch: the detail material's $basetexture is sampled at the atlas uv scaled by $detailscale and combined with the albedo by $detailblendmode; with the switch off the layer is refused; 19 of 19 referenced detail VMTs are absent from this install, so the layer's own texture and blend mode cannot be resolved here; %detailtype is a key in the material that names the layer, not in the detail VMT, and is read above; 3 materials name a %detailtype group (first=tf_bagel_grass); %detailtype names a detail-prop group that VBSP consumes at map compile time (it emits prop_detail sprites and models there), so the key never reaches a runtime shader and has no consumer here
